From 222c1798cf920aafdd2b013009d4491c460f6e9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 16:02:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] soc: mediatek: prove exact A72 binder parent

Combine the terminal membership proof with the exact CPU8 binder
terminal, all ten online CPUs, the matching provider identity,
and a read-only validation of the recent watchdog owner. Keep
the proof disconnected from production execution.
---
 .../soc/mediatek/mt6797-a72-binder-internal.h |  11 ++
 drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-a72-binder-test.c | 154 +++++++++++++++-
 drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-a72-binder.c      | 174 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../linux/soc/mediatek/mt6797-a72-binder.h    |  51 +++++
 4 files changed, 386 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

